	/// Capital plan chart: package A's cumulative net impact in the Low case; blank when Low is the case in view (the emphasised line draws it). Whole $M: the first of these is the chart's first series, and a value axis prints its first series' format on every tick (build step 7).
	measure 'A Cumulative Line (Low)' = IF ( [Selected Scenario] = "Low", BLANK (), [TT Year A (Low)] )
		formatString: +\$#,0,,.\M;−\$#,0,,.\M;\$0\M
